OL,3,GNEWSACouncil formally fights government
OL,4,Aon housing plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has formally put its case to
OL,7,Fthe government on why it believes
OL,8,Fintervention in its local plan is not
OL,9,Fappropriate.
OL,11,FWest Northamptonshire Council wrote to
OL,12,Fthe housing and planning minister
OL,13,FMatthew Pennycook on Monday, ahead of
OL,14,FTuesday's deadline, setting out what it
OL,15,Fsays are exceptional circumstances
OL,16,Fwhich mean intervention is not
OL,17,Fnecessary.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
