OL,3,GNEWSACouncil formally fights government
OL,4,Aon housing plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil leader Mark Arnull says the
OL,7,Fresponse is both "robust" and
OL,8,F"constructive" and said pressing ahead
OL,9,Fwith the current plan could lead to
OL,10,Ffurther delays and uncertainty.
OL,12,FThe government said the authority
OL,13,F"remains under a ministerial direction
OL,14,Fto progress its plan".
